    [5241]={name="Dwarven Flamestick",quality=2,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gathering Idols' - pick it over the other choices. In Loch Modan.",zone="Loch Modan",questName="Gathering Idols",lore="Recently, just before the Troggs surfaced within the site, we had uncovered a large number of strange, carved idols. But we didn't have the chance to study them, for soon after their discovery the Troggs chased us away from the ruins!"},
    [5242]={name="Cinder Wand",quality=2,ilvl=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Arugal's Folly' - pick it over the other choices. In Silverpine Forest.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="Arugal's Folly",lore="As my understanding of Arugal's magic grows so does my disdain for the hapless fool. I am close to completing my research on his so called remedy."},
    [5244]={name="Consecrated Wand",quality=2,ilvl=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Worgen in the Woods'. In Duskwood.",zone="Duskwood",questName="Worgen in the Woods",lore="Here you go. Bring this message to Master Carevin. A few more like you, and we will outnumber the Night Watch! Perhaps then we could complete the work that we few carry on today."},
    [5246]={name="Excavation Rod",quality=2,ilvl=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ormer's Revenge' - pick it over the other choices. In Wetlands.",zone="Wetlands",questName="Ormer's Revenge",lore="While you were down there I happened to notice that one of those beasts stood out from the rest. He was bigger and more menacing. I bet he's the one who led the others here to cause the disruption to the dig site."},
    [5247]={name="Rod of Sorrow",quality=2,ilvl=39,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted!  Otto and Falconcrest' - pick it over the other choices. In Arathi Highlands.",zone="Arathi Highlands",questName="Wanted!  Otto and Falconcrest",lore="The Stromgarde Militia has placed bounties on the heads of Lord Falconcrest, and his bodyguard Otto. Falconcrest heads the Syndicate's efforts in the Arathi Highlands, and his death would cause a major disruption in those efforts."},
    [5248]={name="Flash Wand",quality=2,ilvl=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Pearl Diving' - pick it over the other choices. In Badlands.",zone="Badlands",questName="Pearl Diving",lore="To survive, I have to be tricky! I know the recipe for flash bombs."},
    [5250]={name="Charred Wand",quality=2,ilvl=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dangerous!' - pick it over the other choices. In Hillsbrad Foothills.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",questName="Dangerous!",lore="Dangerous! The following humans of Hillsbrad have been deemed dangerous and are marked for bounty by High Executor Darthalia: Clerk Horrace Whitesteed."},
    [5253]={name="Goblin Igniter",quality=2,ilvl=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Venture Company Mining' - pick it over the other choices. In Stranglethorn Vale.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Venture Company Mining",lore="The Venture Company has a string of operations through Stranglethorn which keeps hard-working goblins, like me, from making honest gold! Please, you must help me!"},
    [5274]={name="Rose Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Morganth'. In Redridge Mountains.",zone="Redridge Mountains",questName="Morganth",lore="After much observation, I have discovered Morganth's plans. He searches for the Scythe of Elune...and he may have found it! If he has, then the Redridge Mountains, and the kingdom of Stormwind, will soon feel his dark might."},
    [5306]={name="Wind Rider Staff",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cry of the Thunderhawk' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Cry of the Thunderhawk",lore="The thunderhawk, is a fierce beast. It is time for you to face them. You must find where it roams, and bring me its wings as proof of your successful hunt."},
    [5310]={name="Sea Dog Britches",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Guns of Northwatch' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Guns of Northwatch",lore="Yet another ship from my fleet has been lost to those overzealous humans at Northwatch Hold! Those bastards must be dealt with. Their paranoia has them in a state of frenzy."},
    [5315]={name="Timberland Armguards",quality=2,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'WANTED: Murkdeep!' - pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="WANTED: Murkdeep!",lore="Attention! A reward is being offered for the death of the murloc \"Murkdeep\"."},
    [5326]={name="Flaring Baton",quality=2,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Escape' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Escape",lore="I suppose I'll learn as we go... Couldn't be too hard. Just some buttons here, and a lever or two... Well, are you ready to go?"},
    [5337]={name="Wayfaring Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stolen Booty' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Stolen Booty",lore="While I'd like to recover all my goods, I'm sure that's not possible. Still, there's a few things that I absolutely must have! As you see, my observatory is ready to go, but it needs the smaller of the two lenses."},
    [5351]={name="Bounty Hunter's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hezrul Bloodmark'. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Hezrul Bloodmark",lore="Hezrul Bloodmark is the leader of the Kolkar centaurs in the Barrens. He is fierce, brutal and cunning. Defeating him would disrupt and fracture the Kolkars, greatly reducing their threat to us."},
    [5356]={name="Branding Rod",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Isha Awak' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Isha Awak",lore="The grand Isha Awak is lord of these waters. Great is his strength, and solemn his pride. The humans on the coast fear him, for he has consumed many of their number."},
    [5542]={name="Pearl-clasped Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=19,reqLevel=14,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [5604]={name="Elven Wand",quality=2,ilvl=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bashal'Aran' - pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Bashal'Aran",lore="It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."},
    [5611]={name="Tear of Grief",quality=2,ilvl=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'For Love Eternal'. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="For Love Eternal",lore="In the aftermath of the battles at the Well of Eternity, I heard that Ameth'Aran had been destroyed, its people dead, including my love, Anaya."},
    [5622]={name="Clergy Ring",quality=2,ilvl=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Tower of Althalaxx' - pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Tower of Althalaxx",lore="Ilkrud Magthrull. Yes, I have knowledge of him. He is a powerful orc warlock that makes his residence at the Fire Scar Shrine, a place of great evil in southwestern Ashenvale."},
    [5766]={name="Lesser Wizard's Robe",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [5770]={name="Robes of Arcana",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=25,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [5820]={name="Faerie Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=32,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Branch of Cenarius' - pick it over the other choices. In Ashenvale.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="The Branch of Cenarius",lore="Anilia puts her hands on your shoulders and draws you close. Gasping, she points towards the arch to the north, before her eyes close and her last wheezing breath leaves her body."},
    [5965]={name="Guardian Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=32,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [6191]={name="Kimbra Boots",quality=2,ilvl=23,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'WANTED: Chok'sul' - pick it over the other choices. In Loch Modan.",zone="Loch Modan",questName="WANTED: Chok'sul",lore="By order of the Magistrate of Thelsamar: Chok'sul, the ogre presumed to be the leader and coordinator of attacks against the town of Thelsamar, Stonewrought Dam, and the excavation site, is wanted dead through any means necessary."},
