    [6664]={name="Voodoo Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=26,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Jin'Zil's Forest Magic' - pick it over the other choices. In Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Jin'Zil's Forest Magic",lore="So excited I am! Three little cages for three little elves! But what shall we do with our lovely tree-hugging friends? Why, let's give them a taste of..."},
    [6677]={name="Spellcrafter Wand",quality=2,ilvl=26,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Retrieval for Mauren'. In Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Retrieval for Mauren",lore="Travelers keep asking me about the Stonetalon Mountains. It seems to be a popular place for adventure--it doesn't matter if you're seeking wyvern, elementals, or you have business with the Venture Co."},
    [6744]={name="Gloves of Kapelan",quality=2,ilvl=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Alliance Relations' - pick it over the other choices. In Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Alliance Relations",lore="The fight goes well. Perhaps the Warchief will allow us to return to our homes before the seasons change if we continue to make such great strides in our battle against the demons and their underlings."},
    [6774]={name="Uthek's Finger",quality=2,ilvl=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha' - pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha! To face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn."},
    [6789]={name="Ceremonial Centaur Blanket",quality=2,ilvl=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha' - pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="But to blow the horn, you need a mouthpiece. To get a mouthpiece, kill Maraudine centaur."},
    [6797]={name="Eyepoker",quality=2,ilvl=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Questioning Reethe' - pick it over the other choices. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Questioning Reethe",lore="It took a long time, but I found Reethe. He hide good for a human. Ogron worried that he might be crazy after so much time in swamp. You come with me for we go get answers from him."},
